VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT cuesheet.worker-loop
GOAL
  Verify code-worker effect handling without trusting the implementing agent.
CLAIM worker-loop REQUIRED
  ENSURE simultaneous and cancelled worker effects never forge completion receipts
VERIFY worker-loop
  USING owner.code-worker-loop
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
